menu "Thermostat Simulator Configuration"

    config THERMOSTAT_SIM_REPORT_INTERVAL_SEC
        int "Simulated DP report interval (seconds)"
        default 30
        range 5 3600
        help
            How often the simulated KETOTEK sends an unprompted Tuya DP
            report (local temperature, setpoint, state) after joining the
            gateway's network, mimicking the real device's autonomous
            periodic reporting behavior.

endmenu
